cff-version: 1.2.0
title: QResAudit
message: >-
  If you use QResAudit in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ahmadh
    family-names: Hassan
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Ahmadh1231/qresaudit'
abstract: >-
  QResAudit converts proprietary Ansys HFSS electromagnetic simulation outputs
  into portable, machine-readable, cryptographically verifiable evidence bundles,
  and provides offline scientific analysis and audit without requiring an Ansys license.
keywords:
  - hfss
  - electromagnetic-simulation
  - resonator
  - quantum-devices
  - reproducibility
  - scientific-software
  - microwave
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: '2026-07-25'
